WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,720 --> 00:00:02,960
Well, what's your name?

2
00:00:03,360 --> 00:00:04,770
Fossa

3
00:00:05,170 --> 00:00:06,350
I asked for your real name.

4
00:00:06,790 --> 00:00:09,910
Skrone

5
00:00:10,350 --> 00:00:13,730
Obtain fifty flesh and blood points

6
00:00:14,370 --> 00:00:16,650
You eat that directly

7
00:00:16,850 --> 00:00:18,850
Yes, it's boring and saves trouble

8
00:00:19,250 --> 00:00:36,560
No threat now

9
00:00:36,920 --> 00:00:38,120
Ask whatever you want

10
00:00:38,360 --> 00:00:39,360
You can take it back and ask.

11
00:00:41,500 --> 00:00:43,020
Where should we go next to find out information for ourselves?

12
00:00:43,500 --> 00:00:45,500
Report back to the camp first

13
00:00:45,740 --> 00:00:47,020
to take on the next task

14
00:00:47,340 --> 00:00:48,740
Then go back and recover as soon as possible

15
00:00:57,180 --> 00:00:58,220
Report immediately after asking

16
00:00:58,380 --> 00:00:59,300
Then take on new tasks

17
00:01:01,380 --> 00:01:03,460
Say why are you gathering there?

18
00:01:03,780 --> 00:01:05,660
Brother, you finally asked me

19
00:01:06,100 --> 00:01:07,740
I'm so broken by you guys

20
00:01:08,100 --> 00:01:09,740
Stop talking nonsense and speak quickly

21
00:01:10,370 --> 00:01:12,170
In order to raid your small camp coins

22
00:01:12,980 --> 00:01:14,420
Haven't had a full meal yet

23
00:01:14,780 --> 00:01:17,380
He was wiped out by a Tang Lang.
